window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The heart-pounding and scorching conclusion to Rhett and Ana’s story.</p> <p></p> <p>You don’t get to be just another creature of the underworld.</p> <p></p> <p>I hoped to never be in the clutches of my sinister uncle again, but I will not let him break me. I wanted to spare Ana from my dark past, but as it seems, she’s a far more cunning player inside the wicked than I could have prepared for.</p> <p></p> <p>Are you ready to work for what it takes to rule it?</p> <p></p> <p>My grief might have made me cold-hearted, but I’m determined to find out the truth behind Rhett’s disappearance, even if it means gaining the trust of the monster who took him from me. There are no rules in devil’s playground, and I’m willing to draw blood, even from myself, to win.</p>"; 
